{"seq":2,"slug":"ranking-reranking","title":"排序与重排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-recommendation-systems/rec-system-engineering/ranking-reranking","wordCount":1015,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"排序与重排序\">排序与重排序</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>排序（Ranking）和重排序（Re-Ranking）是推荐系统级联架构中精细化决策的两个关键阶段。排序层使用复杂的深度学习模型对召回的候选物品进行个性化评分，重排序层在排序结果基础上考虑多样性、时效性和业务策略等因素进行最终调整。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    CANDIDATES[召回候选 ~1000] --&gt; PRERANK[粗排 ~500]&#10;    PRERANK --&gt; RANK[精排 ~50]&#10;    RANK --&gt; RERANK[重排序 ~20]&#10;    RERANK --&gt; DISPLAY[最终展示]&#10;    subgraph 排序层&#10;        RANK --&gt; CTR_M[CTR 预估]&#10;        RANK --&gt; CVR_M[CVR 预估]&#10;        RANK --&gt; DUR_M[时长预估]&#10;        CTR_M --&gt; FUSION[多目标融合]&#10;        CVR_M --&gt; FUSION&#10;        DUR_M --&gt; FUSION&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    CANDIDATES[召回候选 ~1000] --&gt; PRERANK[粗排 ~500]\n    PRERANK --&gt; RANK[精排 ~50]\n    RANK --&gt; RERANK[重排序 ~20]\n    RERANK --&gt; DISPLAY[最终展示]\n    subgraph 排序层\n        RANK --&gt; CTR_M[CTR 预估]\n        RANK --&gt; CVR_M[CVR 预估]\n        RANK --&gt; DUR_M[时长预估]\n        CTR_M --&gt; FUSION[多目标融合]\n        CVR_M --&gt; FUSION\n        DUR_M --&gt; FUSION\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>候选量</th>\n<th>模型复杂度</th>\n<th>延迟预算</th>\n<th>核心目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>粗排</td>\n<td>1000→500</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>5ms</td>\n<td>快速筛选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精排</td>\n<td>500→50</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>30ms</td>\n<td>精确预估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重排序</td>\n<td>50→最终</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>10ms</td>\n<td>全局最优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"精排模型设计\">精排模型设计</h2><p>精排模型是推荐系统中最复杂的模型，需要利用丰富的特征进行精确的 CTR/CVR 预估。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RankModelConfig {&#10;  userFeatures: FeatureConfig[];&#10;  itemFeatures: FeatureConfig[];&#10;  contextFeatures: FeatureConfig[];&#10;  crossFeatures: FeatureConfig[];&#10;  dnnLayers: number[];&#10;  crossLayers: number;&#10;  tasks: TaskConfig[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface TaskConfig {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  type: &#39;binary&#39; | &#39;regression&#39;;&#10;  lossWeight: number;&#10;  tower: number[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface RankResult {&#10;  itemId: string;&#10;  ctrScore: number;&#10;  cvrScore: number;&#10;  durationScore: number;&#10;  finalScore: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computeFinalScore(ctr: number, cvr: number, duration: number, weights: ScoreWeights): number {&#10;  return (&#10;    weights.ctrWeight * ctr +&#10;    weights.cvrWeight * (ctr * cvr) +&#10;    weights.durationWeight * Math.log(1 + duration) +&#10;    weights.bidPrice&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ScoreWeights {&#10;  ctrWeight: number;&#10;  cvrWeight: number;&#10;  durationWeight: number;&#10;  bidPrice: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RankModelConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  itemFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  contextFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  crossFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dnnLayers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  crossLayers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tasks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TaskConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TaskConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'binary'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'regression'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lossWeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tower</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RankResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  itemId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ctrScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cvrScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  durationScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  finalScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeFinalScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cvr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">duration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ScoreWeights</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    weights.ctrWeight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    weights.cvrWeight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ctr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cvr) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    weights.durationWeight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duration) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    weights.bidPrice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ScoreWeights</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ctrWeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cvrWeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  durationWeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bidPrice</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>精排的多目标融合通常使用加权组合公式。在电商场景中，常用 eCPM = pCTR × pCVR × bid 作为广告排序的核心公式；在内容推荐场景中，常用 score = w1 × pCTR + w2 × pDuration + w3 × pLike 进行综合排序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重排序策略\">重排序策略</h2><p>重排序层不仅仅优化单个物品的得分，更关注推荐列表整体的质量。核心目标包括多样性（用户不希望看到一堆相似的物品）、时效性（新物品需要曝光机会）和业务策略（运营规则、广告插入）。精排模型的演进经历了从浅层到深层的过程。早期的逻辑回归（LR）和 GBDT 依赖手工特征交叉；Wide &amp; Deep 引入了 DNN 自动学习高阶特征；DCN（Deep &amp; Cross Network）通过显式交叉层替代 Wide 部分；DIN（Deep Interest Network）引入注意力机制捕获用户兴趣与候选物品的相关性；DIEN（Deep Interest Evolution Network）进一步建模用户兴趣的时序演化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>核心创新</th>\n<th>特征交叉方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LR</td>\n<td>简单高效</td>\n<td>手工交叉</td>\n<td>基线/在线服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wide &amp; Deep</td>\n<td>DNN + 记忆能力</td>\n<td>Wide 手工 + Deep 自动</td>\n<td>通用排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCN</td>\n<td>显式交叉网络</td>\n<td>Cross Network 自动</td>\n<td>高阶特征交叉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DIN</td>\n<td>注意力机制</td>\n<td>兴趣-候选交互</td>\n<td>用户兴趣多样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DIEN</td>\n<td>兴趣演化建模</td>\n<td>GRU + 注意力</td>\n<td>兴趣动态变化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ReRankConfig {&#10;  diversityMethod: &#39;mmr&#39; | &#39;dpp&#39; | &#39;category_balance&#39;;&#10;  diversityWeight: number;&#10;  freshnessDecay: number;&#10;  businessRules: BusinessRule[];&#10;  listSize: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function mmrReRank(&#10;  items: RankResult[],&#10;  lambda: number,&#10;  listSize: number,&#10;  similarityFn: (a: string, b: string) =&gt; number,&#10;): RankResult[] {&#10;  const selected: RankResult[] = [];&#10;  const remaining = [...items];&#10;&#10;  while (selected.length &lt; listSize &amp;&amp; remaining.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    let bestIdx = 0;&#10;    let bestScore = -Infinity;&#10;&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; remaining.length; i++) {&#10;      const relevance = remaining[i].finalScore;&#10;      const maxSim =&#10;        selected.length === 0 ? 0 : Math.max(...selected.map((s) =&gt; similarityFn(remaining[i].itemId, s.itemId)));&#10;      const mmrScore = lambda * relevance - (1 - lambda) * maxSim;&#10;      if (mmrScore &gt; bestScore) {&#10;        bestScore = mmrScore;&#10;        bestIdx = i;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    selected.push(remaining[bestIdx]);&#10;    remaining.splice(bestIdx, 1);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return selected;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function categoryDiversify(items: RankResult[], maxPerCategory: number, categories: Map&lt;string, string&gt;): RankResult[] {&#10;  const result: RankResult[] = [];&#10;  const categoryCount = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const item of items) {&#10;    const category = categories.get(item.itemId) ?? &#39;unknown&#39;;&#10;    const count = categoryCount.get(category) ?? 0;&#10;    if (count &lt; maxPerCategory) {&#10;      result.push(item);&#10;      categoryCount.set(category, count + 1);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReRankConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  diversityMethod</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mmr'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dpp'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'category_balance'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  diversityWeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  freshnessDecay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  businessRules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"c